BT /F2 16 Tf 54 723 Td (Parental Leave Policy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 701 Td (Policy code: POL-HR-031 | Owner: People Team | Effective date: 1 June 2025 | Version: 2) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 679 Td (This version supersedes version 1 dated 1 April 2023. It applies to children born, or placed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 666 Td (for adoption, on or after 1 June 2025.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 641 Td (Summary of changes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 619 Td (- Birth parent and primary adopter enhanced pay increased from 16 to 20 weeks at full pay.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 606 Td (- Partner leave increased from 2 to 6 weeks at full pay, and can now be taken at any time) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 593 Td (   within 12 months of the birth or placement.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 580 Td (- The 26-week qualifying service requirement has been removed: enhanced pay applies from day) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 567 Td (   one of employment.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 554 Td (- Phased return extended from 4 to 6 weeks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 541 Td (- New neonatal leave of up to 12 weeks at full pay.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 528 Td (- Notifications are now made through Keel.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 512 Td (1. Purpose) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 490 Td (Meridian Instruments wants employees to be able to spend time with their families when a child) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 477 Td (arrives. This policy sets a global minimum standard of company-enhanced parental pay, which) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 464 Td (applies on top of the statutory leave and pay rights in each country where we operate.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 439 Td (2. Scope) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 417 Td (The policy covers birth parents, primary adopters, surrogate parents who are the child's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 404 Td (intended primary carer, and partners \(including the other adoptive parent\). It applies to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 391 Td (employees in the UK, the Netherlands, the United States and Malaysia.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 369 Td (Where local law gives a better entitlement than this policy, the local law applies. Where this) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 356 Td (policy is more generous, the company enhancement applies.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 331 Td (3. Eligibility) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 309 Td (Company-enhanced pay applies from the first day of employment. There is no minimum service) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 296 Td (requirement.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 271 Td (4. Birth parent and primary adopter leave) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 249 Td (Birth parents and primary adopters receive 20 weeks at full pay. After the enhanced period, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 236 Td (remainder of any statutory leave is paid at the statutory rate for the country, and any further) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 223 Td (unpaid statutory leave may be taken.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 202 Td (Country | Statutory leave \(summary\) | Company enhancement) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 190 Td (UK | up to 52 weeks | 20 weeks full pay) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 178 Td (Netherlands | 16 weeks pregnancy and maternity leave | 20 weeks full pay) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 166 Td (United States | up to 12 weeks unpaid \(FMLA\) | 20 weeks full pay) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 154 Td (Malaysia | 98 days maternity leave | 20 weeks full pay) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 132 Td (Company pay is paid through normal payroll. Any statutory pay the employee receives, such as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 119 Td (Statutory Maternity Pay in the UK or the UWV benefit in the Netherlands, is offset against) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 106 Td (company pay, so the employee receives no more than full pay in total.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 81 Td (5. Partner leave) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 59 Td (Partners receive 6 weeks of partner leave at full pay. The leave may be taken in blocks of at) Tj ET
endstream
