BT /F1 10 Tf 54 729 Td (least one week at any time within 12 months of the birth or placement. Statutory partner leave) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 716 Td (is included within, not added to, the 6 weeks.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 691 Td (6. Neonatal leave) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 669 Td (Where a baby is admitted to neonatal care within 28 days of birth and stays for 7 or more) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 656 Td (continuous days, each parent may take up to 12 weeks of neonatal leave at full pay. Neonatal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 643 Td (leave is taken in addition to birth parent or partner leave.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 618 Td (7. Adoption and surrogacy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 596 Td (Primary adopters and intended primary carers through surrogacy receive the same entitlement as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 583 Td (birth parents. Reasonable paid time off is given to attend adoption meetings and up to five) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 570 Td (antenatal appointments for the intended parents.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 545 Td (8. Notification) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 523 Td (Employees must notify their manager and the People Team using the Parental Leave Notification) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 510 Td (\(F-301\) at least 15 weeks before the expected week of childbirth, or within 7 days of being) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 497 Td (matched for adoption. The form is submitted through Keel > Requests > Parental Leave and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 484 Td (records the expected date, intended start of leave and any partner leave dates. Leave dates can) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 471 Td (be changed with 28 days' notice.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 446 Td (9. During leave) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 424 Td (Contractual benefits other than salary continue during enhanced paid leave. Annual leave) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 411 Td (continues to accrue under the regional leave policy for your country. Employees may work up to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 398 Td (10 keeping-in-touch days by agreement with their manager, paid at their normal daily rate,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 385 Td (without ending their leave.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 363 Td (Pension contributions continue during the enhanced paid period on the basis of full pay. During) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 350 Td (any statutory-paid or unpaid period, employer contributions follow the rules for your country's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 337 Td (pension arrangement. Life cover and medical insurance continue throughout the whole period of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 324 Td (leave.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 302 Td (Managers should agree with the employee before leave starts how much contact they would like) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 289 Td (during leave, and should make sure the employee continues to receive important announcements,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 276 Td (such as changes to their team, restructures and internal vacancies.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 251 Td (10. Returning to work) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 229 Td (Employees returning from birth parent or primary adopter leave may take a phased return of 6) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 216 Td (weeks working 80% of their normal hours on full pay. The pattern is agreed with the line) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 203 Td (manager before the return date.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 181 Td (Employees who wish to change their working pattern permanently after leave can submit a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 168 Td (Flexible Working Request \(F-315\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 143 Td (11. Repayment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 121 Td (Company-enhanced pay is not subject to repayment if the employee does not return to work.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 96 Td (12. Contacts) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 74 Td (Questions about this policy can be raised with peoplehelp@meridian-instruments.example. Payroll) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 61 Td (questions about statutory pay offsets should go to the payroll team for your country.) Tj ET
endstream
